<title>BELGIUM: EMU criteria should determine membership - Zalm.</title>
<headline>EMU criteria should determine membership - Zalm.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch Finance Minister Gerrit Zalm said on Wednesday that entry into a single European currency should be dictated by meeting the Maastricht criteria.</p>
<p>&quot;Member states that fulfil all of the five criteria, they have to be allowed to join,&quot; Zalm told a committee of the European Parliament.</p>
<p>Responding to a question on an article in the Financial Times which said that a compromise plan was being considered to delay Italy's entry into monetary union, Zalm said he did not read the article, but noted that such a scenario would require &quot;insider knowledge&quot; which he was not privy to.</p>
</text>
